WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.530
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.310
Nonetheless, I will never submit!

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:22.560
I shall slice through the darkness with my blade and break through the storm!

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:33.720
Rei-san was so cool when she got her Uranus Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.150
And hers was the last of the Star Wings.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:41.220
All the conditions for the Sun Dress to appear have been met.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.860
The miraculous dress possessing the sun's radiance...

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.460
I wonder what it's like!

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:49.980
It's hard to contain my excitement just thinking about it!

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.870
I bet...

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:57.490
It's like, "Fwoosh! Fwah!" Just like the raging fires of the corona!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.660
Something tells me that would make it too hot to wear.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.750
Maybe it radiates beauty so intensely that you can't even look at it?

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:10.590
If nobody can see it, who's to say whether it's beautiful in the first place?

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:17.010
Elza-san said that it'll present itself to the idol who shines brightest on stage.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:23.920
When all nine Star Premium Rare Coords have gathered, the Sun Dress is certain to emerge.

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:30.400
Of the nine possessors of Star Wings, only one can obtain it.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:38.280
Kirara-chan has Mercury, Elza-san has Venus, and Rola has Mars.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:45.540
Yume-chan's is Earth, Futaba Aria-chan's is Jupiter, and Yuzu's is Saturn.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:53.300
Rei-san has Uranus, I have Neptune, and Lily-senpai has Pluto.{124356789?}

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:59.930
Yeah, I'm definitely gonna get that 
Sun Dress and become the first-star idol!

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:01.850
Not if Yuzu gets it first!

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.270
Or me!

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:05.320
Regardless of who it is endowed to...

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:13.830
If you let a Venus Ark idol get her hands on it, even if Elza Forte allows it, I certainly will not forgive you.

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:15.010
We know!

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.490
Nice work today, everyone.{I think this is more?}{i was just wordsing}

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.330
Koharu-chan, Lily-senpai! Thanks for coming.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.140
How was your meeting?

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:31.360
Well, they're looking for something fresh, novel, and bold that really shouts "new show".

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:34.130
I'm a bit worried about how ridiculous it'll be.

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:43.350
I was instructed to act like a wholly different Shirogane Lily in order to drive people to instinctively comment on me.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.270
I only hope I can meet their expectations.

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:50.230
I for one am super excited for the new Lilienne!

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:54.770
Okay! Let's all work just as hard to make an impact!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:35.100
Camera rolling! In five!

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.040
Four!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:36.930
Three!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:43.370
What's the S in S4 for?! {this worked out way better than I could have hoped}{....}{qc fix, gotta add ?!}

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:44.560
With that said—

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.100
With what said?

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:50.590
Welcome to the first episode of "What's the S in S4 for?!"

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:52.560
More importantly, Koharu-san.

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:54.830
What is it, Lily-senpai?

00:04:54.830 --> 00:05:02.780
For the all-important pilot of S4's new show, 
why are we the only ones on camera for the jump-in? {they want sharp and itatsuki to be newly defined words. pilot is correct, but I couldn't find an english equivalent of itatsuki}{we could just use "intro" or something}

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:05.990
You've made a sharp observation.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.230
I'd be hard-pressed not to.

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:16.660
As a fellow student of Four Star Academy, you must be aware that our motto is "make good on your word".

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.960
I had absolutely no idea.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:26.840
So as this is the very first episode of the show, I'd like to have S4 follow through on our Four Star motto,

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:30.590
"make good on your word" with words themselves!

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:33.080
I ask again, where did that motto come from?

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:37.530
To help them along, we've prepared a project for them to participate in.

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:41.050
We call it: What's the S in S4 for?!

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:44.380
If you wanna find out, search for it yourselves: The Game!

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.650
Boom, boom! Fweet, fweet!{I feel like maybe there are too many fwords in this script}{fsteak}

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.280
Take a look!

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:52.660
It's S1 through S4 in search of the S's.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:55.660
Could you please explain the rules?

00:05:56.550 --> 00:06:05.230
Sure! For this project, we've hidden various S's all around Kirakira City, where Four Star Academy is located.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:06.970
Various S's?

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:11.350
They're cards that have different names of things starting with the letter S on them.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:19.210
The members of S4 will have to find envelopes containing them hidden at locations given to them in clues.

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:23.810
Once you find one, you beat the game!

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:28.280
And not only that, but you receive what was written on the card as a present!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.980
I see. Those are rather simple rules.

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:33.830
But don't get overconfident.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:37.540
Some of the hidden S's have "miss" written on them.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.290
And if you take too long to finish...

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:45.530
The Teachers will be released into the wild to hinder you!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:49.220
H-How horrifying!

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:55.600
What happens if they hinder them so much that they're unable to find an S before time runs out?

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.190
They'll face an intense punishment!

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.810
What punishment?

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:03.340
It'll be given by our Venus Ark collaborators.

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:05.820
With fingers forged by the raging seas...

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.560
The tickles!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:12.320
Tickle tickle come on! 
Tickle tickle tickle come on!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:15.200
M-My, how scary...

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:21.040
Let's ask our brave S4 contestants how they feel about this harsh trial.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.120
L-Lily-senpai, that's my forehead.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:27.380
How do you feel, contestant?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:30.630
I-I'm confident I'll find an S.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:33.150
I'll be the first to find one!

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:36.520
But forget me, you're really into this, Lilienne!

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:40.270
I will find the most splendid S of all...

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.940
I will avoid the tickles at all costs!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.840
Yay!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:15.590
Let's take a look at the first S, 
found by Yuzu-sama at the live house.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.810
It's the Solo Live S!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:22.350
I found it so fast I'm not sure they'll have enough usable footage!

00:08:22.350 --> 00:08:24.230
That's all from us in the field.

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:26.410
Yuzu-senpai is amazing.

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:29.480
That was Saya-san, live on scene. Thank you very much.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:33.280
She found it immediately without any consideration of her surroundings.{longhood}

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.470
That's our rolling stone, Yuzu!

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:38.610
Koharu! Lily-senpai!

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:44.920
It sounds like Yume-chan's commentator, Rola, is calling us from the aquarium.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.750
Rola-san?

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:51.760
I'm here at the dolphin show pool from the clue that Yume ended up with.

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:58.390
Her hint was, "Who snatched Theater Class's appeal time from them during the Star Captor Festival?"

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:07.280
Will Yume be able to find her S within the time limit and avoid the tickle punishment?

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:12.070
If I remember right, the one who took over Theater Class's appeal time was...

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.280
The dolphin!

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.240
Okay!

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:25.920
Up!

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.420
Found it!

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:39.180
Now, come over here!

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:44.140
Yume got the S!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.680
Yay!

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:49.940
You did great. Here.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:59.930
Now, we're all just dying to see what S Yume got.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:01.160
What?!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.040
The S of Sakuraba? {don't you worry, I'm going to fix this sign}{conspiracy coverup cosomethingelse}

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.350
Does it mean I get Rola?

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:10.670
But even without that card, 
the two of us are always together.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.550
As best friends.

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:14.800
And eternal rivals.

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.110
I won't lose.

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:17.370
Neither will I.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:26.180
Their passionate bond is even hot enough to melt my absolute-zero tundra heart.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.420
Sakuraba, GET!{if you say so}{it's a fun episode}

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:30.440
Koharu! Lily!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:35.320
It looks like Arisa-senpai is calling to fill us in on Ako-chan.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:39.570
Yes, we're here at the department store's rooftop event space.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:43.200
Will Ako-chan be able to find her S here?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.250
My S can only stand for Subaru-kyun!

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.790
Just as Yume found Rola, I'll find him too!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.160
Definitely, without doubt...

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.340
There it is!

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:01.220
Whoa!

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:07.350
Ako-chan has taken her deeply desired S in hand at long last!

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.140
Subaru-kyun!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.730
Miss

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:11.730
Miss

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:11.730
Miss...

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.230
Back to you at the studio.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:21.990
With all of the excitement going on outside, 
the countdown timer is steadily ticking down.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:25.100
Let's check out how Mahiru-chan is doing.

00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:27.360
Yuri-san, are you there?

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:31.870
Hi, hi! Kasumi Mahiru-san is currently at the stadium. {yeah, that feels better}

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:36.130
Oh?! It looks like she's found an S envelope!

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.580
What does it contain?

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:43.010
It can't be! Unfortunately, it's a miss!

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.810
If I don't find an S soon, then the tickles...

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.500
Not the tickles...

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:53.520
<i>It happened at the time of my earliest memories.</i>

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:58.740
<i>It was a time when I enjoyed tickling more than my three square meals a day.</i>

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:02.110
<i>There was the first wave of the tickle boom...</i>

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.270
<i>Then the second, and finally...</i>

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:08.830
<i>The fateful third tickle boom arrived.</i>

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.190
I'm a tickle tickle alien!

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:13.210
Tickle tickle!

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:19.280
<i>Ever since then, I've been traumatized by tickling and being tickled.{timing overlap}</i>

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:23.880
<i>Even more so than missing my three square meals!</i>

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.730
All tickling...

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:30.520
Should be banished from reality!

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.390
Back to the studio!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.660
And, go!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.660
It's the special guest corner!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:55.500
For this episode, in addition to the tickling specialists Rei-san and Kirara-chan,

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:59.090
we've invited one more special guest from Venus Ark.

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.880
Could it be her?

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.300
Cut to Lilienne!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:07.050
Hello! I'm pleased to introduce our special guest...

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.220
Yes, it's Miranda-san!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:14.980
Let's ask her about her thoughts on the search for S.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.900
Meow! Meow! Meow meow!

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.660
We should have expected that. She's a cat.

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.990
She's fickle as expected.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:33.750
I should take her place? Understood.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.590
I can hear the sound of S.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.050
It's an S!

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:50.260
It's me! I was in it!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.100
In flower language, parsley means "festive".

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.350
It is just as I said yesterday—

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:59.100
"Yuzu, that is not a cookie, but an eraser."

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.900
Arisa here again.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:08.780
Ako-chan just found her second S here at the CD shop!

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:13.040
This time it's sure to be Subaru-kyun's S! {fix my mistakes please}

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.870
Oh, whatever, I'll take anything at this point.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:19.790
Back to the studio.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:23.420
That leaves only Mahiru-chan without an S.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.670
That's the Teacher Time alert!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:30.180
The Teachers have been released to hinder!

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:30.180
Hinder hinder. Hinder hinder!

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:33.970
Hinder hinder come on!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:34.680
Come on!

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:35.470
Come on!

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:41.940
This is Ashida Yuri! Kasumi Mahiru-san is heading to Kirakira Park as indicated by her clue.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.650
But what's this?!

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:50.450
The released Teachers have all convened to hinder the last remaining contestant!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:51.030
Hinder hinder!

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:51.950
Come on!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:58.290
Incredible! She's getting past everything thrown at her by the Teachers, her very own instructors! {shidousha}{asd, etc.}

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:03.790
Is it her drive for the S that has pushed her focus to unseen levels?!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.630
<i>Anything but tickles...</i>

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.220
Hinder-der-der...

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.930
<i>Not tickles!</i>

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.560
Never!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:30.070
Whoa! She's completely cleared the Teachers' hindrance!

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:36.410
I'm cutting it close, but I have to make it somehow!

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.120
Hang in there, Miranda!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.540
Hang in there. Hang in there!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.710
Hang in there, Miranda!

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.090
Miranda?

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:54.850
What's wrong?

00:15:54.850 --> 00:16:00.100
She climbed up a tree while chasing a balloon, but now she can't get down.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.770
What about the S card?

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.190
This is more important!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.940
Mahiru-chan!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.830
Almost there!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.800
I've got you, mischievious lady.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.600
Mahiru-chan!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.150
Everyone!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.980
Thank goodness.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:58.160
Here.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.870
I'm sorry.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:04.620
You're going to be punished because of Miranda.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.210
I'm just glad she's safe.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:11.630
It pains me to do this, but those are the rules.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:13.340
I know.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:17.010
Then the rest of us will take the tickles along with Mahiru-chan.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:17.640
Huh?

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:24.890
After all, if I had been the one to discover Miranda in distress, I would have done the same as you.

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:26.900
You girls!

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:30.980
S4 shines together and takes punishments together.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:34.900
Your tickles are all of S4's tickles!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:42.120
Okay, here come the tickles forged in the raging seas.

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.910
Are you prepared?

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.380
Tickle tickle tickle tickle...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.760
Isn't that?

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:59.180
It's an S envelope, Mahiru-chan!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:07.690
Whoa, the staff have given her a special OK!

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:08.810
Mahiru-chan!

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:09.940
Yay!

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.480
You did it!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:12.400
Yeah!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.450
Stage!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:29.620
Woohoo! You got the best reward of all!

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:30.830
Yeah!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:41.680
Kasumi Mahiru, like a radiant light!

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.700
Bloom and flourish, my dress!

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:01.420
And with that said—

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.710
Again, with what said?!

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:09.220
That was our new show, What's the S in S4 for?! Did you all enjoy it?

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:18.980
Next week we'll have more splendid guests!

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:21.730
Let's find splendid S's!

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:23.530
Yay!

00:23:55.830 --> 00:24:00.460
The Sun Dress will appear before the idol who shines brightest on stage.

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:01.790
I can't contain my excitement!

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:06.460
Until I reach the sun with my Neptune Wings, I won't stop my Aikatsu!

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:10.050
By the way, what's the S in S4 really stand for?

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:13.800
Quiz time! What spice did I just include?

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:15.220
Huh? Um...

00:24:15.220 --> 00:24:18.560
It's a secret ingredient in both curry and Aikatsu.

00:24:18.560 --> 00:24:20.680
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:21.810
Aikatsu in Love.{isn't this more like}

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:24.190
Become the first-star idol!
